            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ubuso 22:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali bulya ubushiku nga bwafika mu musumba wa Yerusalemu mukalafuma amenshi ayamweo, yamo yakalaya kuli bemba ulubali lwa ku kabanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bemba wa ku kabanga:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila Bemba Wamfwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", yambi nayo yakalalola kuli bemba ulubali lwa ku masamba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bemba wa ku masamba:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila Bemba wa Meditelaneani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Ayo menshi yakalapitafye mu mainsa na mu lusuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo nomba ninshi ni Yawe e mfumu ya pesonde lyonse, ninshi nomba ekafye ewalaba Yawe, ne shina lyakwe lyekafye elyo nomba abantu bakalalumbula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icalo conse icashinguluka umusumba wa Yerusalemu cikaba icabatama nga ku Araba, ukutendekelafye ku Geba lubali lwa ku kapinda ka ku kuso, ukuya shintafye na ku Rimoni lubali lwa ku kapinda ka ku kulyo. Lelo umusumba wa Yerusalemu ukaba uwasansama ukucila ne calo icaba mu mbali yauko. Umusumba ukatula ku mpongolo yakwa Benjamini, ukuya fika na ku mpongolo ya petungi, palya pabelele impongolo yapakubala, elyo kabinge ukufuma ku lupungu lwakwa Hananeli, ukuya fika na palya balekamina imfumu ya calo umwangashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ubuso 22:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bakalaikalila mu musumba ku matwi tondolo, takwakabe nakabili uukalapangila ukonaula umusumba wa Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba mishobo yonse abalwishishe umusumba wa Yerusalemu, Yawe akabaletela icikuko icabipisha pamo ngeci. Imibili yabo ikalabola ilyo ninshi nabeminina pa makasa yabo, na menso yabo yakalabola mu fikumbi fya yako, ne ndimi shabo shine shikalabolela kumo mu tunwa twabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo nshita Yawe akapelenganya amano ya bantu abakalwisha Yerusalemu. Bakalaba no mwenso icakuti bonse umo umo bakalaikatanapo no munabo umo, no kulashomboka nankwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Yuda nabo bakaiposamo no kuya lwa ku Yerusalemu. Ifyuma fya bantu ba iyo mishobo iyashinguluka yonse, ifili nga golide, silifa ne fyakufwala ifingi, abena Yuda bakafilonganya no kufitapa bakafitapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico cine cikuko ecikalaipaya na bakabalwe, ne mfalashi, ne ngamila, na bapunda, ne fitekwa fyonse ifikalaba mu nkambi sha balwani babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
